			"notes": "### Added\n\n- The faces of the other players float above them on the HUD while they are in view, and stick to the edge of the\n  screen in the direction you have to turn while they are not.\n- Icons are hidden for players close by and fade in with distance; name and distance are shown below the face.\n  Face and text can be switched off and resized separately.\n- A key (`J` by default) shows and hides the icons.\n- With the mod on the server, players are shown at any distance in the same dimension, not only within the render\n  distance. Players without the mod can still join, they just see no icons.\n- Settings in `config/playericons.properties`, editable in game through NeoForge's mod list or Mod Menu.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/welles/minecraft-player-icons/commits/v1.0.0"
		}
